---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Homelab — Siddhant Dembi"
  description="Documentation of my Proxmox homelab infrastructure, local AI platform, monitoring and backup systems."
>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">HOMELAB</p>
      <h1>Building and operating my own infrastructure.</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        A collection of technical write-ups covering virtualization,
        Kubernetes, networking, local AI, automation, monitoring and backups.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="projects">

      <a class="project" href="/homelab/proxmox/">
        <div class="number">01</div>
        <div class="content">
          <h2>Proxmox Homelab Infrastructure</h2>
          <p>
            Three-node on-premise infrastructure built around Proxmox,
            containers, virtual machines, Kubernetes, DNS, VPN and secure
            remote access.
          </p>
          <span>Read write-up →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="project" href="/homelab/local-ai/">
        <div class="number">02</div>
        <div class="content">
          <h2>Local AI &amp; LLM Platform</h2>
          <p>
            GPU-accelerated AI infrastructure using Ollama, OpenWebUI,
            local LLMs, Hermes Agent, N8N and Stable Diffusion.
          </p>
          <span>Read write-up →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="project" href="/homelab/monitoring/">
        <div class="number">03</div>
        <div class="content">
          <h2>Infrastructure Monitoring &amp; Backup</h2>
          <p>
            A self-hosted reliability stack covering 3-2-1 backups,
            scheduled snapshots, centralized monitoring and automated alerts.
          </p>
          <span>Read write-up →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 24px 100px;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #777;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .projects {
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
  }

  .project {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 38px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .project:hover h2 {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .number {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .content p {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 14px 0 20px;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .content span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page {
      padding: 60px 20px 80px;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .project {
      grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>